            <ArticleTitle>Sore or Swollen Lips Part 3: Diagnosis and Treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>70-2, 74</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This series of three papers reviews the causes, diagnosis and differential diagnosis, and outlines the management of sore and/or swollen lips. Clinical relevance: Sore and/or swollen lips are not uncommon, often have a local cause but may reflect a systemic disease. The previous 2 papers in the series discussed their causes. This paper reviews their diagnosis and treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
